#
# app_include_js -- the Sophia page loads the shared runtime itself, with
#     frappe.require("/assets/ucc_intelligence/js/shared.js", boot). Adding it
#     to every Desk page as well would load it twice for no benefit.
#
# knowledge re-indexing -- "ucc_intelligence.knowledge.ingestion.reindex_stale"
#     is a valid daily entry (hooks-reference.md) but is only worth enabling
#     once real documents are registered. Left out rather than scheduled
#     against an empty index.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
